      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Arriving in stores this week, LOEWE's Fall/Winter 2026 collection dresses plush bags like the Amazona 180, Flamenco and Cala in a coat of camel-toned shearling, finished with futuristic accents — glossy lambskin, rectangular chains and silver coil details — for a look that feels warm yet coolly avant-garde.",
