      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The Amazona 180 medium bag is crafted in deep chestnut soft calfskin and wrapped in warm, opulent brown long-hair shearling whose fluffy, lustrous pile calls to mind a plush cushion — cozy and comforting. Designed to mark the house's 180th anniversary, the Amazona 180 carries over the original's signature rectangular silhouette, squared corners and leather trim, while the single handle and open-top design lend it a relaxed, slouchy attitude.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
